  "AMP HIGHER EDUCATION SCHOLARSHIP - 2026",
  "2 Ways to Apply - Either Apply in Private or through Public Crowdfunding Platform",
  "Association of Muslim Professionals",
  "(AMP) invites applications for its Higher Education Scholarship Fund for the Year 2025.",
  "With the noble intention of helping needy Muslim brethren, AMP has initiated the ‘",
  "Higher Education Scholarship Fund",
  "’ since 2013. The purpose of this fund is to provide financial assistance to genuinely needy Muslim Students for",
  "Higher & Professional Education.",
  "300+ meritorious & needy students",
  "will be given a minimum",
  "Rs 10,000/-",
  "(Rs. Ten Thousand) as a scholarship for their studies. The students will be shortlisted based on",
  "their credentials",
  "and evaluation by",
  "AMP Scholarship Selection Team.",
  "Apply at the below link for the fixed AMP Scholarship :",
  "As earlier, you have the option for directly applying for AMP Scholarship in PRIVATE.",
  "https://tinyurl.com/HigherEducationSupport",
  "Additional PUBLIC CROWD-FUNDING Assistance:",
  "Further, those students desirous of",
  "additional monetary assistance",
  "for their fees along with the Scholarship, can apply for crowdfunding on our Zakat-based platform as follows:",
  "1. Register by logging in to the portal",
  "www.IndiaZakat.com",
  "2. Click on the",
  "“Raise a Cause”",
  "button at the top right of the home page.",
  "3. There are 5 tabs in the “Raise a Cause form.” You need to fill all five tabs to successfully raise the cause.",
  "4. In the section \"Choose Category\", please select Scholarship from the dropdown menu.",
  "Scholarship Eligibility Criteria:",
  "1) It is open for students belonging to economically poor families to pursue higher professional education.",
  "2) Students must be eligible to receive Zakat under Sharia guidelines.",
  "3) Students should have passed at least Class 12th or equivalent from any Board.",
  "4) Preference will be given to Students who pursue higher education in the Professional disciplines of",
  "Medical, Engineering, Law, Journalism",
  ", with special preference given to Top Universities or Colleges in India like IITs, IIMs, IISC or GLC and others recognized by UGC/ AICTE.",
  "5) It would also cover technical and vocational courses in Industrial Training Institutes/ Industrial Training Centers affiliated with the National Council for Vocational Training (NCVT) of classes at Graduation level.",
  "6) The disbursal will be done only through Online payments to the respective Institutions and no Cash disbursal will be entertained.",
  "7) The Scholarship will be awarded only to Meritorious and Needy Students after complete background verification.",
  "Documents Required:",
  "1) Passing Certificates/ Mark sheets of 10th & 12th Standard or equivalent.",
  "2) All the previous year’s mark sheets of the Professional course (For candidates already enrolled in the middle of the course).",
  "3) Copies of Photo & Address Proof (preferably Aadhar Card) or (PAN Card/Ration Card).",
  "4) College Fees Structure",
  "5) College bank account details",
  "Important Note:",
  "1) The",
  "background verification",
  "will be done by local AMP Chapters & NGO Partners",
  "2) Last Date to Apply:",
  "Sunday, 31st August ‘26",
  "No hard copy",
  "application will be accepted",
  "4) The",
  "Scholarship cause on",
  "IndiaZakat.com",
  "will be promoted on Social Media for donors' contributions.",
  "For any inquiries or information, email us at:",
  "scholarship@indiazakat.com",
